{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33303","headline":"里中女 · 于濆","name":"里中女","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾闻池中鱼，不识海水深。\n吾闻桑下女，不识华堂阴。\n贫窗苦机杼，富家鸣杵砧。\n天与双明眸，只教识蒿簪。\n徒惜越娃貌，亦蕴韩娥音。\n珠玉不到眼，遂无奢侈心。\n岂知赵飞燕，满髻钗黄金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于濆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33303.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33303","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}